WEBVTT

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:05.180
In the near future, Doc Terror and his cyborg companion, Hacker,

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:07.920
unleash their forces to conquer Earth.

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:13.410
Only one force can stop this evil: a handful of brave men.

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:17.700
In specially created exo-frames, they can be transported anywhere

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.660
to fuse with incredible assault weapon systems,

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:24.260
beamed down from the space station Sky Vault,

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:30.000
becoming man and machine, power extreme.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:36.730
Max Ray, brilliant sea operations commander.

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:42.020
Jake Rockwell, rugged land operations specialist.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:49.050
Ace McLeod, daring air operations expert.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:54.500
Whatever the challenge, they are ready.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.170
The Centurions!

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:32.580
You're all straight from the back, it's a bird!

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:33.580
That's everything, mate.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:35.380
We need the Saturn!

00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:52.790
Doc Terra must be after the new Deep Space Shuttle, Crystal,

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:56.850
Bemis Tidal Blast, Sky Bolt, and Wild Weasel!

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:58.160
Ah!

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:12.360
Rock Terror's gonna be sorry he attacked before Jake had his morning coffee.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.350
Have a nice day.

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:03.240
And why didn't you go after Doc Terror then?

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:05.930
He was gone by then, Mr. Lomax.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:10.180
We returned to the station as soon as the danger to the school was averted.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:15.400
And you lost Doc Terror and the new Deep Space Explorer Shuttle?

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:19.010
Not to mention blowing out the Saguaro Power Plant,

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:21.170
blacking out Greater Metropolitan Phoenix,

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:24.290
causing 13 million dollars in property damage.

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:27.980
We thought saving the lives of those people in the school

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:30.000
counted more than property, Mr. Lomax.

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:50.200
Mr. Ray there were no people in that school Oak Canyon School has been deserted for 50 years since the dam was built that is before you gentlemen buried it but it wasn't buried we saved it I'm sure there's a reasonable explanation

00:04:50.200 --> 00:05:00.000
perhaps but until we find it as representative of the World Council of Scientists I'm suspending you from active duty till the investigation

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:10.460
is over you are no longer centurion that went bar to deal with doctor sometime

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:15.060
himself if he doesn't think we can do our job how long is this going to last

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:19.980
crystal the investigation committee has just arrived until they make their

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:30.000
report sky vault and centrum are off limits mizk

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:34.160
I'm Senator Kimbu. This is Dr. Togo, Mr. Stein.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:39.440
We'll need access to all SkyBalt's computer records for our investigation.

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:43.630
Earth Shuttle now boarding. All passengers for Earth.

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:57.050
Don't call us. We'll call you.

00:05:57.050 --> 00:06:00.000
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:06.210
So do I. That's why I did a little security violation before they kicked us out.

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:12.160
We never did this.

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:18.160
Look! There's two scars up there, not one.

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:22.470
And that closer one buried the school buildings.

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:26.470
You mean someone came along after we left and buried the school?

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:29.570
We've been set up, guys.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.000
But why?!

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:34.890
That's what we're going to find out!

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:50.670
The Lord's bomb is in place.

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:54.250
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:56.310
Now I have the Lord!

00:06:56.510 --> 00:07:00.000
I have only to activate the bomb, and very soon,

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:05.160
Skywalk will be nothing more than an orbiting cinder.

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:12.090
Hmm, hmm, hmm, hahahaha!

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:20.320
They teach you guys burglary in the Air Academy Ace?

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:23.400
Just a natural talent, Groundhog!

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:34.570
Max, I don't get this.

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:36.950
Why would someone have framed us?

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:40.500
Maybe to get the investigating committee up to Sky Vault?

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:02.250
Please, I get a fight.

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:04.690
That thing had better work.

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:11.320
It works.

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:15.660
I think one of the investigating committee is working for Dark Terror.

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:20.710
Why not tell the council?

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:25.160
Tell them what? We have no proof of anything. Yet.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:30.000
I'm hoping we can find a lead in their personnel.

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:34.100
files. Just as I thought. Lomax hasn't changed

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:38.160
his department's password in years. Accounting department logged

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:42.600
on. What information do you require? Financial records on

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:46.600
Senator Siobhan Kimbu, Dr. Akira Togo, and Mr. Louis Stein.

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:50.980
Searching. If I'm right, Doctor set us up

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:54.960
knowing there'd be an investigation. And an opportunity to get

00:08:54.960 --> 00:09:00.000
someone into Sky Vault. Search completed. Senator Siobhan

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:05.460
lives with daughter-in-law and grandson at 11250 Park Lane.

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:07.750
Financial records: Normal.

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:11.430
Dr. Akira Toko, specialist in exo-frame research.

00:09:11.430 --> 00:09:13.200
Zero-gravity combat.

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:15.460
Financial records: Normal.

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:18.350
Mr. Louis Stein, personnel analyst.

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:22.480
Lives alone at 60759A Brook Street.

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:24.600
Records show: Heavily in debt.

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:27.700
-What would that little guy be doing to get himself in debt?

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.030
-Why don't you ask him?

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:37.970
They really ought to ban those things.

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:39.760
All right, Shadow.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:41.630
Do your act.

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:44.630
Well, who have we here?

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:47.450
What happened to you, my friend?

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:49.400
Are you hurt?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:53.150
No collar.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:55.700
Poor fella. Are you lost?

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:08.070
Doesn't feel broken.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:13.270
But if it isn't better when I get back from Sky Vault, I'll take you to a vet.

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:26.720
I don't find any reason for him to be in debt.

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:30.000
He's not such a bad little cuss.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:35.460
after all we don't have much time to find out who the traitor is and what Doc

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:54.230
terror is up to mr. McLeod I bet you say that to all your partners

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:04.410
Well, Mr. McCrowd, shall we try it with exo-frames?

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:05.830
Exo-frames?

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:08.700
I've designed my own exo-frame.

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:12.390
I'm interested to see how it compares with the official ones.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:15.900
I even designed my own power packs.

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:30.000
I see my exo-frame still needs a little work.

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:38.360
The real exo-frames are telepathically attuned to your brainwaves, aren't they?

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:40.660
Something like that.

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:45.950
That's what we need: the true fusion of men and technology.

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:51.640
But of course, those who govern will always stand in the way of genius like men.

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:57.980
That sounds like Doc Terror talking.

00:11:57.980 --> 00:12:00.000
Stein could be selling out to Doc

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:10.340
terror to pay his debts he seems like a harmless little guy no that is he's gone

00:12:10.340 --> 00:12:30.000
to visit his aunt here comes granny I'm afraid not Chelsea he's got the flu you know find any

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:35.460
nothing that tells us anything it could be any of them if they stole something

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:40.720
it would have to be awfully small they didn't have much look maybe they didn't

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:45.490
take anything out maybe they brought something in you think one of them

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:51.010
planted something up there not a bad bet max ray calling sky vault come in

00:12:51.010 --> 00:13:00.000
crystal what is it max you got a famous up there at 1800 hours this evening the shuttle will

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:08.930
be arriving I'll beam you in them their shuttle at docking Bay 7 thanks crystal

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:13.730
we might have only a short time to search before before you're all thrown

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:19.400
in a break for treason I thought you might try to disrupt the investigation

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:24.290
mr. Lomax if you don't allow us to search this station the investigation

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:30.000
might be permanently disrupted by a bomb what are you talking about

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:35.250
I've got a theory that one of these investigators planted something on Sky Vault yesterday.

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.350
All right, search!

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:56.010
If you're wrong, touch that, Mr. Ray.

00:13:56.010 --> 00:14:00.000
That is not a bomb. It's a... a signal jammer.

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:03.610
Doc Terra promised me no one would be harmed.

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:05.870
He only wants the computer files.

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:09.930
I transmitted them down along with the records of the hearing to the World Court in Geneva.

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:11.550
