00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:13.210
I will bring the world to its knees!

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:18.310
Defense alert! World Court buildings under attack!

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:21.440
Knock out the transmission tower!

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:41.090
What?

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:43.430
Get rid of the bomb just in time.

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:47.430
Until we recover the computer memory, we can't beam anything from SkyBall.

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:53.880
But we can still use with our weapon systems and take the shuttle route.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:01.970
