00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:52.370
"I couldn't let Doc Terra get all that power! He's so evil!"

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:11.180
Mr. Ray cut a hole in the wall and got me out! And when I grow up, I want to be a centurion!

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:17.010
Just out of curiosity, why did you suspect me and Stein of working for Doctora?

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:23.830
I bet it was because of my debts. I'm always borrowing money to care for hurt animals, I find.

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:30.000
It's expensive, but it's worth it, isn't it, old friend? And while I may

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:34.620
to use technology to help govern the world I don't want to rule it for dark

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:41.220
terror are you sure you won't reconsider your decision to resign Senator Kim

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:48.330
boo no if I let my family get in the way of duty once I might do it again I want

