it's our pleasure oh come on you should have asked for a raise or an extra week

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:23.880
of vacation we've had our vacation it's about time we got back to work must be

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:30.000
120 out there and in here it's 75 degrees without an air conditioner come on outside

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:35.460
I'll show you how it works. The roof is covered with soil a yard deep and three

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:40.440
sides of the place are covered as well. This keeps out the heat. The whole south

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:45.540
side is glass. In the winter when the sun is lower in the sky it shines all day

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:50.760
long to warm us up. A thick layer of insulation all around helps keep the heat

00:20:50.760 --> 00:21:00.000
in all night. This is a new chapter in an old story. The Hopi Indians built whole cities in South

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:04.160
facing cliffs.

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:07.660
Our wastewater goes back into the ground to irrigate our plants.

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:12.480
With a few more places like this, we could turn the desert back into a forest.
